<%- include('partials/header') %>
<div class="container mt-5 text-center">
  <h1 class="fw-bold">About Anime Explorer</h1>
  <p class="lead mt-3">
    Anime Explorer is a web app where you can search, explore, and save your favorite anime.
    It uses the <strong>Jikan API</strong> to fetch real-time data from MyAnimeList.
  </p>

  <h3 class="mt-4">✨ Features</h3>
  <ul class="list-unstyled">
    <li>🔍 Search anime by title</li>
    <li>⭐ Add anime to your Favorites</li>
    <li>🌙 Toggle between Dark/Light mode</li>
    <li>📑 Paginated results for easy browsing</li>
  </ul>

  <h3 class="mt-4">🛠️ Built With</h3>
  <p>Node.js, Express, EJS, Bootstrap, and Jikan API</p>

  <h3 class="mt-4">👨‍💻 Developer</h3>
  <p>Created by <strong>Debashis Goswami</strong></p>
  <p>
    <a href="https://github.com/yourusername" target="_blank">GitHub</a> |
    <a href="https://linkedin.com/in/yourusername" target="_blank">LinkedIn</a>
  </p>

  <footer class="mt-5">
    <p class="text-muted">Anime data © MyAnimeList via Jikan API</p>
  </footer>
</div>
